(564,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Google\'s five Nobel laureates: Sundar Pichai proud of colleagues\' achievements','5435454545454','article','Google\'s five Nobel laureates: Sundar Pichai proud of colleagues\' achievements',0,1,1,0,1,1,0,NULL,'<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Google CEO Sundar Pichai has expressed pride in his colleagues winning Nobel Prizes for the second consecutive year. Congratulating Michel H. Devoret and John M. Martinis, who won the Nobel Prize in Physics this year, he said that this is a unique achievement for Google and a result of the company\'s long-term investment in science and research. Google CEO Sundar Pichai has expressed pride in his colleagues winning Nobel Prizes for the second consecutive year. Congratulating Michel H. Devoret and John M. Martinis, who won the Nobel Prize in Physics this year, he said that this is a unique achievement for Google and a result of the company\'s long-term investment in science and research. Google CEO Sundar Pichai has expressed pride in his colleagues winning Nobel Prizes for the second consecutive year. Congratulating Michel H. Devoret and John M. Martinis on winning the Nobel Prize in Physics this year, he said, \"This is a unique achievement for Google and the result of the company\'s long-term investment in science and research.\" Google CEO Sundar Pichai expressed pride in his colleagues\'</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">winning the Nobel Prize for two consecutive years. Congratulating Michel H. Devoret and John M. Martinis on winning the Nobel Prize in Physics this year, he said, \"This is a unique achievement for Google and the result of the company\'s long-term investment in science and research.\"</span></div>','1760087391U8i5FUPQ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,76,NULL,0,NULL,0,1,0,'true',40,0,NULL,'2026-03-12 09:14:13','2026-03-12 03:14:13','Google\'s five Nobel laureates: Sundar Pichai proud of colleagues\' achievements'